OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G0000FEras: Phil Collins
OL,5,     GZoe Ball meets a young Phil as he
OL,6,     Greceives the present that will
OL,7,     Gchange his life, books his first
OL,8,     Ggig in the West End, and ambles
OL,9,     Ginto the audition that will seal
OL,10,     Ghis destiny.
OL,11,G0030FEras: Phil Collins
OL,12,     GReeling from the breakdown of his
OL,13,     Gmarriage, Phil Collins begins
OL,14,     Gwork on his first solo album -
OL,15,     Gfeaturing a drum fill that will
OL,16,     Gecho through pop music history.
OL,17,G0100FEras: Phil Collins
OL,18,     GAt the midpoint of the 1980s,
OL,19,     GPhil Collins reigns supreme. Live
OL,20,     GAid! Miami Vice! The red hot hit
OL,21,     Gstreak to end all hit streaks!
OL,22,     GWelcome to Phil's imperial era.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
