OL,4,G0130FEras: Phil Collins
OL,5,     GBruised by the tabloids, Phil
OL,6,     GCollins begins his gradual
OL,7,     Gretreat from show business. But
OL,8,     Gretirement is easier said than
OL,9,     Gdone for the hardest-working man
OL,10,     Gin pop.
OL,11,G0200FDance Sounds of the 90s with
OL,12,     FVernon Kay
OL,13,     GYour name is on the guest list so
OL,14,     Gjoin Vernon Kay for an hour of
OL,15,     Gpure club floorfillers!
